==================================================
100 JS Interview Questions Quick Summary
==================================================
1. Scope: var (function), let/const (block scoped).
2. Equality: == converts types, === strictly verifies values and types.
3. Arrow function: Inherits surrounding parent this context lexically.
4. Promises states: Pending, Fulfilled, Rejected.
5. Event Loop: Shift queue microtasks first, then macrotasks to Call Stack.
6. Copying: Spread (shallow), structuredClone (deep).
7. Debouncing: waits for inactivity pause. Throttling: executes on regular interval ticks.
8. storage: localStorage survives tab exit; sessionStorage clears on tab exit.
